      "html": "† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">גַּו</span>]</big>  <strong>substantivo.</strong>[<strong>masculino.</strong>] <strong>costas</strong>—somente com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּוֶּ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.9\">1Rs 14.9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּוֵּ֑ךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.35\">Ez 23.35</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גַּוָּם</span> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.26\">Ne 9.26</a>;—sempre <span dir=\"rtl\">הִשְׁלִיךְ אַחֲרֵי ג׳</span> <em>lançar para trás das costas</em>, isto é, tirar da mente, ignorar, rejeitar <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:9\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.9\">1Rs 14.9</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:35\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.35\">Ez 23.35</a>, e sua lei <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:26\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.26\">Ne 9.26</a>.",
